                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Sad to say, but The Hand Of Glory 1 and 2 are far more broken sword than BS 3 and BS 4. Revolution need to stick with 2D. Seriously. BS 5 was good, but I've heard horrible rumours that they are yet again trying to force some use of 3D down our throats in Parzival's Stone. What the fuck is their problem?\n\nThis game is so bad:\n1. Weird story\n2. Super-clunky controls\n3. Annoying camera angle changes\n4. No names for hotspots\n5. Platforming elements\n6. Unskippable cutscenes and dialogues\n7. Glitches in graphics, characters stepping through objects, especially stairs\n8. Heavy interface that is extremely slow to respond\n9. Places don't feel beautiful scenes like in BS 1 and 2.\n\nReally. It's that bad.",
